  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.147` to `4.1.149`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.147...application_builder_helpers/4.1.149)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): narrow over-eager routing and forgiveness guards by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/684\n* docs: add struct-compatible parser sample (Fixes #680) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/685\n* fix(cli): report surplus word after resolved help target (Fixes #677) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/686\n* fix(cli): route root-opt past bankable globals, promote agreed shared-base defaults by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/687\n* fix: consolidate command-first routing, childless-only miss, strict flags by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/688\n* fix(cli): nuke pre-slot lookahead and canonical rebind by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/689\n* fix(cli): forgive surplus-after-help only when leaf owns a positional slot (Refs #677) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/690\n* fix(cli): restore bool positional literal table (Fixes #691) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/693\n* fix(cli): uniform exit-2 for surplus after resolved help path (Fixes #692) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/694\n* Bump AbsolutePathHelpers from 0.3.148 to 0.3.149 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/695\n* Bump xunit.runner.visualstudio from 4.0.0 to 4.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/696\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261006042727.276c4c7...build.20261013061220.fd6030d",
